      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……很厉害吧，那孩子。\n不愧是元祖“怪物酱”啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0eedefd90862961e9fd6308f45da1cd4fffe200592e92f59d0b03012e0d6eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
