    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17bbfff37bce7cbdf527acdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“怪物酱”——\n这是海塞克现役时期的绰号。",
      "source_fingerprint": "250a11df6320e586ad7410eb122adbd077d4b7fbdb9b492ad98a6ae09de7387a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0010/storytimeline_400010004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5392d016ab894db14b3c03a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从地方一路无败进入中央，\n可爱又最强的“怪物酱”，\n让全日本为之狂热……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3f3e72de9153bbd68d2047cf0cb51505bc8828987d55ff9e8d045bf73899bf4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0010/storytimeline_400010004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36e7f3ef15b3380d8e71bf47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "登上漫画杂志的封面，出演电影……引起社会现象的她，成为了比赛热潮的导火索。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83edee4fba6b772359dea3114960f9b0517905de5ae03fdb5933b5710daaf307",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0010/storytimeline_400010004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760e6fa9764946e800c667e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——而她……\n现在依然像“怪物”一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df1a1c7d29ef04b65caa6edf5280721a2453039ece45e91df508026d687fcf8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
